@template gruff
== career.worried
? tier>=colleague flag:career.missed
- Missed shift. Hm. Don't make it two.
? tier>=friend flag:career.low
- Calder's calling you in. She's fair. Take what she says. Then do it.
? tier>=friend flag:career.verylow
- Captain, now. Listen, {nick}. I've seen good people go this way. Not you.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.bottom
- Morning. Bay. Eight. I'll be checking.   #serious
? tier>=friend flag:career.up
- On time today. Hm. Good.
== career.eve
? tier>=friend flag:career.eve
- Tomorrow. Hm. Shame. Real shame.   #serious
== career.bye
? tier>=friend flag:career.lastday
- Off you go, then. Stand up straight. You'll do.   #warm
